{
  "$comment": "EXP-1321/1324: THE Queue x4 (web components/agent-session, desktop steer_viewer, iOS AgentSessionView, Android AgentSessionScreen): ONE block at the bottom of the transcript, in the transcript's reading column, directly above the queued-messages strip, replacing the background-task/`Waiting on` lines AND the Work card's `tasks` variant. Paint = a `Trace` (fixtures/trace.json, size `sm`) of two `TraceCollapsible`s: `todo` (its icon + title, OPEN by default; the reader's toggle sticks for the session) whose content lists its items as Trace lines (item icon + label + description; state `running` = the title shimmers, `pending` = the line at pendingOpacity), then `completed` (collapsed by default) whose items are lines at pendingOpacity. A running background item's description (elapsed) ticks once a second. Model = pure `taskQueue(input)` (src/task-queue.ts); mirrors compare the WHOLE expected object. N-12: the block is a DockCard of THE Dock (fixtures/dock.json `tasks`): collapsed = the todo title, the completed title, the first todo item and its description; open = this Trace in the sheet's body.",
